{"title": "Hellfire", "pageid": 23052, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hellfire", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the special hellfire surface. For the regular fire surface, see <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire (surface)</a>.   For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Hellfire (disambiguation)\">Hellfire (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fire_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Fire_surface.png/300px-Fire_surface.png.webp, /w/images/a/a1/Fire_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Fire_surface.png/300px-Fire_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Fire_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Hellfire</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a>. When stepped on, characters will catch on fire and take Fire damage every round that ignores any fire <a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">resistances</a>. Unlike regular fire surfaces, Hellfire surfaces cannot be extinguished with Ice.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Deals 6d6 Fire damage per turn that ignores <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistances</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immunities</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" title=\"Dippable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dippable\">Dippable</a></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Roiling_Hellfire\"> Condition: Roiling Hellfire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roiling_Hellfire_(Condition)\" title=\"Roiling Hellfire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Roiling Hellfire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Roiling_Hellfire_(Condition)\" title=\"Roiling Hellfire (Condition)\">Roiling Hellfire</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Flames from the heart of Avernus engulf this entity, inflicting <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Exhaust\" title=\"Hellfire Exhaust\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Exhaust\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source