ark</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diabolic_Chains\" title=\"Diabolic Chains\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/30px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/45px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/60px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diabolic Chains\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/30px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Diabolic_Chains\" title=\"Diabolic Chains\">Diabolic Chains</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ravaging_Inferno\" title=\"Ravaging Inferno\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/30px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/45px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/60px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ravaging Inferno\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/30px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ravaging_Inferno\" title=\"Ravaging Inferno\">Ravaging Inferno</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellflame_Cleave\" title=\"Hellflame Cleave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/30px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/45px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/60px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellflame Cleave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/30px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hellflame_Cleave\" title=\"Hellflame Cleave\">Hellflame Cleave</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Hellfire Surfaces <i>cannot</i> be extinguished using Ice spells like <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Ray of Frost\">Ray of Frost</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" title=\"Dippable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dippable\">Dippable</a>: Dipping <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">weapons</a> into this surface will make them deal an additional 1d4 Fire damage.</li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP li